  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 2 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the hereby permitted building shall be as shown on the approved drawings in accordance with the following specification:\r\n\r\nBrickwork - Yellow London-Stock brickwork - Ibstock 'London Reclaim Mixture.'\r\nWindow / door frames - Jeld-Wen 'Dark Oak' \r\nWhite render - STO - Stolit K 'Natur 1.0' \r\nSedum Roof - Sedum sexangula\r\nOther roof - Lead.\r\n",
    "Condition : 3 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposal contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith (PP/01, PP/02, and RR.001 Rev. A; received 6 June 2012: PP/03 Rev. A, PP/04 Rev. A, PP/05 Rev. A, PP/06 Rev. A, PP/07 Rev. A, PP/08 Rev. A; received 3 August 2012: Energy Performance Statement received (Ref. 1375) Rev. A received 3 August 2012: Drainage Statement by Momentum Engineering received 6 June 2012) and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 4 - The dwelling shall not be occupied until the Sustainable Drainage Scheme, in accordance with the Drainage Statement received 6 June 2012 by Momentum Engineering has been installed and completed. The drainage system shall be maintained permanently thereafter.",
    "Condition : 5 - The dwelling shall not be occupied until the measures detailed in the Energy Performance Statement (Ref. 1375) Rev. A received 3 August 2012 have been installed and completed. These measures shall be maintained permanently thereafter.",
    "Condition : 6 - Notwithstanding the provisions of the Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development Order) 1995 (or any order revoking or re-enacting that order) no enlargement of the premises or any additional structures/buildings within the curtilage of the site shall be carried out.",
    "Condition : 7 - The hard and soft landscape works shown on the approved drawings shall be implemented prior to the occupation of the dwelling.",
    "Condition : 8 - A splay of 2.4m x 2.4m shall be provided on each side of the access, the depth measured from the back of the footway and the widths outwards from the edges of the access, and no fence, wall or other obstruction to visibility exceeding 0.6m in height above the surface of the adjoining highway shall be erected within the areas of such splays.",
    "Condition : 9 - The dwelling shall not be occupied until a vehicle crossover that has a maximum width of 2.4m at the property boundary with 1m splays to either side at the kerb has been constructed with the existing redundant crossover in front of the property removed and replaced with a footway and kerb."
  ],
